cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Analysis code for "A National Food Consumption Reference for Food Safety
  Risk Assessment in Somalia"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated
  paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohamed Aden
    family-names: Hersi
    affiliation: Somali National University
    email: maxersi@snu.edu.so
  - given-names: Osman Abubakar
    family-names: Fiidow
    affiliation: Somali National University
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Somalia
  - food consumption
  - household consumption and expenditure survey
  - dietary exposure assessment
  - food safety
  - SIHBS
abstract: >-
  Complete analysis pipeline deriving a nationally representative food
  consumption reference for Somalia from the Somalia Integrated Household
  Budget Survey (SIHBS) 2022, covering unit-code resolution, non-standard-unit
  conversion, implausibility screening, per-capita and person-weighted
  estimation, survey weighting, and design effect sensitivity analysis.
